WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:11.320
Hello!

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:16.620
Whoever you are, and wherever you came from, welcome to your future!

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:21.800
Now, you're probably wondering where exactly you are,

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.640
and who exactly we are.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:27.440
Unfortunately, that's not something we can tell you at this point.

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:34.580
The purpose of this short educational video is to inform you and your fellow inductees what you should expect

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:37.160
from your new life here at the Foundation.

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:45.280
First of all, you will be given a unique identification number, tatooed directly onto your chest.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:47.760
We wouldn't want you to lose it, would we?

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:49.340
Hahahaha!

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:51.700
This will become your new name.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:57.340
You, and every one of your colleagues will be referred to henceforward as Class-D.

00:00:57.340 --> 00:01:00.000
The "D" stands for "delightful".

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.000
Haha!

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:04.840
Now that you are equipped with your new identity, what's next?

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:08.380
Well, this is where the fun begins.

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:10.260
Let's talk fashion!

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:13.300
Say goodbye to your borin' old clothes.

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:19.360
Here, you will be fitted with our super comfortable standard-issue electric orange overalls,

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:23.800
to keep you warm and cozy while performing your assigned responsibilities,

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:27.140
all the while keeping you looking fresh and professional.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:30.700
Speaking of responsibilities, let's talk about yours!

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:34.480
Your purpose here is to accommodate your supervisor's demands,

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:37.000
(Those are the friendly guys with the guns)

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.740
such as: cleaning up nasty messes,

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:42.280
interacting with interesting characters,

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:44.900
(don't go off script! Hahahaha!)

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:46.880
making sure you're in tip top shape,

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:48.900
(the infirmary is always open!)

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:51.420
and fufilling interdepartmental deliveries,

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:53.940
and much, much more!

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:57.880
You couldn't ask for a more exciting living environment!

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:03.160
Just remember these four simple points, and your time here will be a walk in the park!

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:07.660
Number one, a locked door is a happy door.

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:11.420
Number two, questions are bad.

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:16.560
Number three, supervisor satisfaction is key!

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:21.380
And finally, number four. No pain, no gain.

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:23.440
But it doesn't end here!

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:28.300
If you successfully complete one month of rigorous Class-D work...

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:29.800
...wait for it...

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:34.760
you get to go home, no strings attached! You're free!

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:37.920
I'd say feel free to come back and visit anytime, but

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:39.820
we can't tell you where we are!

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:41.980
Hahahahahahaha!

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:48.380
So, what are you waiting for? Get out there and make us proud like your life depends on it!

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:54.940
Thank you for listening, goodbye, and most importantly, good luck!

